=== REGRESSION DIAGNOSIS ===
Discrepancies: EmergencyBypassFIFOScenario was expected to become satisfiable after model and scenario alignment, but it remains UNSAT. All other outcomes match expectations.
Analysis: Despite repeated model adjustments to align Emergency processing logic and the scenario predicate (including a shift from per-request to per-group processing semantics), EmergencyBypassFIFOScenario cannot be realized in the model. This suggests either (a) an overconstraint or misalignment in the scenario definition relative to the actual requirement, (b) an unrecognized modeling error, or (c) a latent inconsistency or ambiguity in the requirement itself—particularly regarding whether the scenario demands something not actually permitted by the requirements as stated (e.g., whether it is possible for both a high-classification and a low-classification pending request to coexist in Emergency mode, with only the high-classification requests processed and the low remaining pending in the next state, under the given constraints and scopes).

