=== BLOCKING QUESTIONS ===
- Question: Is it a strict requirement that, in Emergency mode, it must always be possible for at least one high-classification and one low-classification request to both be pending at the same time (in the same state), so that a transition can process all and only the high-classification requests, leaving the low-classification requests pending? Or is it possible that, due to other system constraints (e.g., clearance, processing liveness, role assignment, or scope limitations), such a state may not always exist within the modeled bounds?
